'''Linked''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 2]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
It’s blade is silver stained. The guard and pommel of the handle use a golden color, and the grip of the handle uses a blue and black striped pattern.

==Trivia==
*This knife is based of the Roblox gear [https://web.roblox.com/catalog/125013769/Linked-Sword Linked Sword].
*Linked is a darker version of "[https://www.roblox.com/library/175665384/SKIN-LinkedKnife LinkedKnife]" created by [https://www.roblox.com/users/2495296/profile nettimato]. 
*This knife’s description is, "This knife goes way back to the golden"
*This is one of the many knives that can be found in other Murder games. 

